OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAnthropic says it will commit 5% of its
OL,4,Ashares to 'public benefit fund'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe AI industry has come under intense
OL,7,Fscrutiny recently over safety concerns
OL,8,Fand fears about its impact on society
OL,9,Fand the economy. Anthropic reportedly
OL,10,Fsaid in its initial public offering
OL,11,F(IPO) filing that AI could pose
OL,12,F"catastrophic or existential risks to
OL,13,Fhumanity".
OL,15,FAnthropic said its proposed fund could
OL,16,Fsupport nonprofit organisations, and
OL,17,Fefforts to address AI's impact on the
OL,18,Fjobs market.
